            "review_title": "Review at Boma Beach Club",
            "review_text": "charles m\n51 contributions\n0\nGreat setting and food , just a corporate party that spoilt the lovely setting !\nJul 2023 • Couples\nSuperb food and a lovely setting, attentive staff . Only problem was that they had booked a corporate event with the loudest announcer and team building music , and it totally spoilt our evening and the ambiance. We went for dinner and the vegetarian options were delicious , so we will try again tonight. We are staying at the hotel from Sunday so will write another review.\nRead more\nWritten July 15, 2023\nBoma Resort Nha Trang\nThank you for choosing Boma Beach Club as a resting place for you and your family. We will take note of your comments and improve our service better.\n\nWe hope we can welcome you on more occasions in the future.\n\nDear,\nBoma team.\nRead more\nWritten August 30, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
